  Slug: mirrored-aegis
  DisplayName: Mirrored Aegis
  IconPath: icons/equipment/shield/heater-steel-spiral.webp
  Description: "Usage any shield This shield is polished so brightly it can reflect
    even spiritual and ethereal attacks. Immanence (aura) The mirrored aegis emits
    an aura in a @Template[type:emanation|distance:15] that protects you and all
    allies in the aura from harm, granting a +1 status bonus to AC. If the mirrored
    aegis houses your divine spark for 10 uninterrupted minutes, it is restored to
    full Hit Points. Transcendence\u2014 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Raise
    the Walls] 1 (force, transcendence) @Embed[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.IBEbFlMmDbGsrN4G
    inline]"
  SourceTitle: Pathfinder War of Immortals
  SourcePack: classfeatures
